{"text":"The next day, you go back to the bank where the book's turtle would sleep. Far from the crocodile's breathing hole, you dig into the soft mud under the ice, slowly, the way you buried the bone. Your hand finds something hard and round. A turtle, asleep, cold as a stone. Then another one, a little further along. You don't enjoy what comes next. But you don't waste any of it, either. Even the shells. One holds water.","mood":"story","settings":{"stability":0.3,"style":0.6,"speed":1.1},"alignment":{"characters":["T","h","e"," ","n","e","x","t"," ","d","a","y",","," ","y","o","u"," ","g","o"," ","b","a","c","k"," ","t","o"," ","t","h","e"," ","b","a","n","k"," ","w","h","e","r","e"," ","t","h","e"," ","b","o","o","k","'","s"," ","t","u","r","t","l","e"," ","w","o","u","l","d"," ","s","l","e","e","p","."," ","F","a","r"," ","f","r","o","m"," ","t","h","e"," ","c","r","o","c","o","d","i","l","e","'","s"," ","b","r","e","a","t","h","i","n","g"," ","h","o","l","e",","," ","y","o","u"," ","d","i","g"," ","i","n","t","o"," ","t","h","e"," ","s","o","f","t"," ","m","u","d"," ","u","n","d","e","r"," ","t","h","e"," ","i","c","e",","," ","s","l","o","w","l","y",","," ","t","h","e"," ","w","a","y"," ","y","o","u"," ","b","u","r","i","e","d"," ","t","h","e"," ","b","o","n","e","."," ","Y","o","u","r"," ","h","a","n","d"," ","f","i","n","d","s"," ","s","o","m","e","t","h","i","n","g"," ","h","a","r","d"," ","a","n","d"," ","r","o","u","n","d","."," ","A"," ","t","u","r","t","l","e",","," ","a","s","l","e","e","p",","," ","c","o","l","d"," ","a","s"," ","a"," ","s","t","o","n","e","."," ","T","h","e","n"," ","a","n","o","t","h","e","r"," ","o","n","e",","," ","a"," ","l","i","t","t","l","e"," ","f","u","r","t","h","e","r"," ","a","l","o","n","g","."," ","Y","o","u"," ","d","o","n","'","t"," ","e","n","j","o","y"," ","w","h","a","t"," ","c","o","m","e","s"," ","n","e","x","t","."," ","B","u","t"," ","y","o","u"," ","d","o","n","'","t"," ","w","a","s","t","e"," ","a","n","y",